#: ../../tools/core_tools.rst:32 2704ef88cf5546d99150af8077f31a6d
msgid ""
"**Description**: Fetch an open-access PDF (commonly returned by "
"CORE\\_search\\_papers) and return bounded text snippets around provided "
"terms. This is a local (download + scan) full-text search fallback when "
"index-based search misses body-only keywords. Extraction backends: "
"PyMuPDF (fitz), pypdf, or markitdown (auto-selects fastest available "
"unless \\`extractor\\` is set)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/core_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/core_tools.rst:95
#: 4287d23364bc4239af42e5e0d465a905 63aef863629940a8b881959cbe315384
