"``max_pdf_bytes`` (integer) (optional) Maximum PDF size (bytes) allowed "
"for download/scan. Prevents timeouts on huge PDFs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/core_tools.rst:63 47898bd4ba92461fbca443eede6ac9a0
msgid ""
"``max_pages`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of PDF pages to scan "
"when using fitz/pypdf extractors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/core_tools.rst:66 c48b8a1e0a0f433e89be9333dacc901f
msgid ""
"``max_text_chars`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of extracted text "
"characters to scan for term matches (limits CPU/memory)."
